     1547   on ctrl-f of Date-order in frame Dialog-Frame
     1548   do:
     1549     if (can-query (self, "sensitive")
     1550        and
     1551        self :sensitive = true
     1552        )
     1553     or (can-query (self, "read-only")
     1554        and
